sec.p:
TRIzol-Reagent (Invitrogen, Carlsbad, CA, USA) was used to extract total RNA according to the manufacturer’s instructions. PCR analyses were performed using the following specific oligonucleotides:
P21 forw:5′-TACATCTCCCATTTCACCTAC-3′;
P21 rev: 5′CGTAATTTCTCCAAGATCTCC-3′;
ACT forw: 5′-TCACCCACACTGTGCCATCTACGA-3′;
ACT rev: 5′-CAGCGGAACCGCTCATTGCCAATGG-3′.
